      "id": "compute-cover-nerve-rank",
      "name": "Compute CoverNerve rank readout",
      "description": "Accepts one RMN Mark carrying a JSON {\"entities\":number,\"cells\":number,\"components\":number} request and returns h0rank, h1rank, coordinationFree, landauerBits, coordinationCost, a source-pinning certificate, and measured local cost, specified by Obsmetrologia/Cohomology/CoordinationCohomology.lean and Obsmetrologia/Cohomology/LandauerEntropy.lean and pinned by sha256.",
