      "id": "read-normalized-relational-graph",
      "name": "Derive relational graph component and rank readout",
      "description": "Accepts exactly one typed RMN normalized-simple-graph request with at least one sorted unique string vertex and sorted unique canonical edges; derives a canonical component partition, CoverNerve H0/H1 ranks, coordination and Landauer readouts, exact and harmonic ranks, source qualification, and measured provider effects.",
